 lists the Chapel of Mary among its worship locations.","short_summary":"Close the loop with a reflective campus landmark.","evidence_claim":"Stonehill states that Masses are celebrated throughout the week in the Chapel of Mary, Chapel of Our Lady of Sorrows, and residence-hall chapels.","source_url":"https://www.stonehill.edu/connect-with-community/clubs-organizations/","source_title":"Clubs & Organizations | Stonehill College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Worship times and building access vary; consult Campus Ministry’s current information before visiting.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
